**Read:** [Principles of Extractive Metallurgy — Tarun Kumar Kundu, NPTEL](../sources/Principles-of-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_7VCNEHN5VCQDDQTZ512PSHFZ78), the complete hydrometallurgical/electrometallurgical and biological process sequence; [Non-ferrous Extractive Metallurgy — Ray and Pugazhenthy, NPTEL](../sources/Nonferrous-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_29G1ZF58Y8EG123MNX3ZRNRE2W), all hydrometallurgy of copper and refining material; [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), the whole relevant solution route and shared water/residual systems; [Extractive Metallurgy of Copper — Schlesinger, Sole, Davenport, and Alvear Flores](../sources/Extractive-Metallurgy-of-Copper.lingua#r_47NCQVYD4J2DXH9AV48XDMNHJ7), complete chapters 14–16 and their connected cases, when available.

Oxide-bearing, secondary-sulfide, primary-sulfide, and recycled copper feeds can respond differently to solution-based routes. Mineral associations, surfaces, reaction products, flow/contact, biological contributions where present, and solution chemistry affect kinetics and selectivity. A generic copper assay does not determine a suitable leach model.

Join leaching, liquid/solid separation, solvent extraction or another purification route, electrowinning, water/reagent recycle, and residue. Local improvements interact: stronger dissolution can increase impurity load; solution carryover can affect the cell; recycled water can change both upstream reaction and separation.

Use full constituent, liquid, charge, and energy accounts with inventory and measurement uncertainty. Separate solution extraction, whole-route metal recovery, current efficiency, and accepted cathode output. A chemical-equilibrium diagram or a successful short batch experiment does not establish every continuous/heap and plant interaction.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete copper solution-route case with the full methods and operating/test evidence. Independently check stage/recycle and charge balances, reproduce a significant kinetic or extraction calculation, and validate against independent feed/conditions. Compare a different preparation/purification arrangement with product, reagent/water, residual, and maintenance consequences. Explain which remaining scale-up or measurement uncertainty most affects the route choice.

**Continue:** [Connect copper product quality with refining, gas chemistry, structure, and use](Copper-purity-oxygen-alloys-conductors-and-fabrication.lingua#r_3SAWE0GBR52FS13AHT520Z5CH2).

